{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Handstand Hank is a punishing experience that will test your patience while you attempt to traverse your way up a mountain of obstacles. <i>Jump</i>, <i>Fall</i> and <i>Rage</i>\u00a0your way through  increasingly difficult challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308150/extras/handstand_hank_gameplay.gif?t=1749449453\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Get Ready for a Challenge:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 brutality difficult areas - Each one introduces new, unique challenges to overcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two ways to play - <i>Easy Mode</i> with checkpoints or <i>Hard Mode</i> where each fall is costly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An unmatched triumph awaits those who reach the top.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308150/extras/fall_english.png?t=1749449453\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308150/extras/handstand_hank_falling_short.gif?t=1749449453\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3308150?t=1749449453","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3308150?t=1749449453","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308150/111981e0bc2c2449c5df4b29d9656da754825cab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749449453","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308150/111981e0bc2c2449c5df4b29d9656da754825cab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749449453","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_de